{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(cheese?)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (cheese?)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/3/6031b50268abc20ef76b107d9cdc4926e8d7e88e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{x-2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" /> has:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf51d6f1b11338f8e72ac3aa5b8d62d892884561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\text{ real roots }\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\text{ real and}\\ 1\\text{ imaginary root}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\text{ imaginary roots}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{ no roots}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1\\text{ real root}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"866\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/3/6031b50268abc20ef76b107d9cdc4926e8d7e88e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{x-2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" /> Original Equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a19b44a3c89788e914eb5914135f291e9a792a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x-2} = 4 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"21\" /> Subtract x from both sides\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/346689fdb673db15a62c74b44d5d541345f8435a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2 = 16 - 8x + x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" /> Square both sides\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830fe5eeae05a1b9ce20923776bc41af0395803e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 9x + 18 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" /> Get all terms on one side\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b5909e7c8ba3b9f541c1026482a6c878c87fc81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-6)(x-3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" /> Factor\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca290e15125ba4c767df687e562ca7ceae09179e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\{6, 3\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If you put down A as your answer, it's wrong. You need to check for extraneous roots.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7ad189e72a7c2a4a3daae47fa9222ee648f3e3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + \\sqrt{6 - 2} = 6 + \\sqrt{4} = 6 + 2 = 8 \\ne 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"298\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b95ca742accac962c8c009f5e2e1a7afcb6d1195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + \\sqrt{3-2} = 3 + \\sqrt{1} = 3 + 1 = 4 \\checkmark$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"278\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>There is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2bac9d13376abb88907b92c86c2f77976633faa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\text{1 real root}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>It's not hard to note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> simply works, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c5bce3f5cae65457aaa77794d24605a1586aad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + \\sqrt{1} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />. But, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is increasing, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/9/ce902c84aee5b853bd37b482903e1388fac72fa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> is increasing, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the only root. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dd301c6c773458ccd5c1e20cc38ca982f9ab512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73d2076fd3164f957c7c9fa84248810fec87790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{x-2} &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />, and similarly if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/40021522907621bc0f912e4deafdda58a6d30922.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/5183e6c8a8b3ed060d7d3e3408194934aeb895d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + \\sqrt{x-2} &gt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />. Imaginary roots don't have to be considered because squaring the equation gives a quadratic, and quadratics either have only imaginary or only real roots.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can create symmetry in the equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/2/052cab21665b2a2b97017bbe1b553daa7347c9ec.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+\\sqrt{x-2} = 4\\]\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb1f87005413371bd5924cd40ce71bf4887e4106.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x-2+\\sqrt{x-2} = 2.\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91e16d35b1e9ad42945b7b59f0c79a875f28b3c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\sqrt{x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"19\" />, then we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/4376001c21822ea06fb863e4deb5eaf3848d8bfb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2+y-2 = 0\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e02130defae692ae2f7049ad041be88220d77e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(y+2)(y-1) = 0\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />\nThe two roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdb569ff5e90446195e08cffa1bdf9f5dc8b1bfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x-2} = -2, 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"120\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Notice, that the first root is extraneous as the range for the square root function is always the non-negative numbers (remember, negative numbers in square roots give imaginary numbers - imaginary numbers in square roots don't give negative numbers); thus, the only real root for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> occurs for the second root; squaring both sides and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/41018b040c6045d2aa493f539d296a1f17a548ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\text{1 real root}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~Vndom\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_4_.28cheese.3F.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(cheese?)\">Solution 4 (cheese?)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (cheese?)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Yes this is a super old competition, but it is still great practice (as of 10/15/2026). Use Descartes' Rule of Signs, which states that the number of sign changes in f(x) is the number of positive real roots, and in f(-x) is the number of negative real roots. Trying out f(x), you get 0 sign changes. Trying out f(-x), there is one sign change, therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/988014cd8695a6af8f411f36a07c680211cc232f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} \\text{1 real root}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-N.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017062904\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 307/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3464/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 236/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5799/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.825      1 -total\n 60.84%   10.845      1 Template:AHSME_50p_box\n 37.49%    6.682      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10450:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017062904 and revision id 293750. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}